SWYNEX – Interactive Sales Dashboard

Project Overview

This project is part of Task 3 of my SWYNEX Data Analytics Internship.

The objective is to create an interactive dashboard using Microsoft Power BI to analyze sales and profit performance.

Dataset

Global Superstore Cleaned Dataset.

Tools Used

- Microsoft Power BI
- Microsoft Excel

Dashboard Features

- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Total Orders
- Total Quantity
- Sales by Region
- Profit by Category
- Monthly Sales Analysis
- Interactive Filters and Slicers

Objective

To present useful business insights through interactive visualizations and KPIs.

